; Frame routine of the game: sound effect, then the game frame
;
; The routine the interrupt handler #R$8585 calls each frame during the game and the intro room 0: #R$85FC puts its
; address in #R$8504 after the title menu. It plays one step of the beeper sound effect (#R$871A) and jumps to the game
; frame #R$A596. The sound step comes first: when an effect is playing it keeps the CPU for about 7,000 T-states
; (observed), so the game logic of that frame starts later in the frame.
; .
; Hardware: the beeper, through #R$871A.
@label=GameFrameRoutine
c$85E2 CALL $871A
 $85E5 JP $A596
